    //     (>= 128 tests, exhaustively enumerating bit positions per AESAVS
    //     KAT structure -- GFSbox, KeySbox, VarKey, VarTxt) sub-sampled to
    //     three representative tcId (first / middle / last) per group.
    //   - MCT: full Monte Carlo loop (100 outer x 1000 inner) implemented
